1
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:52,440
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:54,160
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:55,920
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,920
=Episode 20=

5
00:00:59,119 --> 00:00:59,560
Zhou Yan.

6
00:01:00,399 --> 00:01:01,200
I was in your debt.

7
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:02,799
Now I'm paying you back.

8
00:01:18,359 --> 00:01:18,760
Daya!

9
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:29,079
Daya!

10
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:33,920
Ma Ding.

11
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:37,760
Grand Royal...

12
00:01:39,519 --> 00:01:39,840
is gone.

13
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:42,519
I'm...

14
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,959
I'm clean now.

15
00:01:49,159 --> 00:01:50,560
Don't scare me.

16
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:52,799
Don't scare me.

17
00:01:53,319 --> 00:01:54,120
Wake up!

18
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:56,640
I'm taking you home, Daya.

19
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:59,519
Open your eyes.

20
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:04,280
The bracelet...

21
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,159
you gave me...

22
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:09,639
I'm taking it with me.

23
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:26,400
Daya!

24
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:29,199
Daya, don't...

25
00:02:29,719 --> 00:02:30,759
Don't scare me, Daya.

26
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,360
Open your eyes.

27
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,360
Look at me.

28
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:34,719
Daya!

29
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:36,159
Daya!

30
00:02:36,919 --> 00:02:39,360
I'm taking you home, Daya.

31
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,000
Don't leave me.

32
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:43,240
Look at me, Daya.

33
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:45,800
Daya!

34
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,120
Still laughing?

35
00:02:53,719 --> 00:02:54,120
Laugh!

36
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:55,560
Laugh!

37
00:03:18,439 --> 00:03:18,879
Die!

38
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:19,879
Die!

39
00:03:19,919 --> 00:03:20,800
Zhou Yan, enough!

40
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:21,520
Die!

41
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:23,599
You can't keep hitting him!

42
00:03:24,319 --> 00:03:25,639
Hand him over to the police.

43
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,759
Neither Lin Sihan nor Daya

44
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:32,240
would want to see you like this.

45
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,000
- Ren!
- Ren!

46
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:45,719
You...

47
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:48,080
Mian told you

48
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,639
not to go after Grand Royal.

49
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,560
You should remember

50
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,039
every word he says.

51
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,000
And do exactly as he says.

52
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:55,840
All for this ledger?

53
00:03:57,159 --> 00:03:58,240
What's in this ledger?

54
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,240
What's so secret about it?

55
00:04:00,719 --> 00:04:01,719
My job's done.

56
00:04:02,599 --> 00:04:03,520
Mian's furious.

57
00:04:03,919 --> 00:04:04,599
You'd better watch yourself.

58
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:07,719
Ren.

59
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,680
Mian's not someone you can count on.

60
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,400
Why are you so loyal to him?

61
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,279
I owe him.

62
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,519
I won't let him down.

63
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,000
Ma Ding.

64
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:40,720
I call you Boss.

65
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:42,560
You wanted revenge.

66
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,160
I came with you.

67
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,720
Why'd you have to go after
that stupid ledger?

68
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,319
Now the ledger's gone.

69
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,240
So that ledger

70
00:04:55,199 --> 00:04:55,800
mattered more than Daya's life

71
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,879
and our brothers' lives?

72
00:05:01,199 --> 00:05:01,759
You won.

73
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:04,000
Natuo's finished.

74
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,040
Grand Royal's gone.

75
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,160
But what about her?

76
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,800
Who's going to give her back to me?

77
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,839
Who's going to give her back
the life she wanted?

78
00:05:20,519 --> 00:05:22,519
You're not some god of Langia.

79
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,439
All she wanted

80
00:05:26,759 --> 00:05:27,839
was to start over,

81
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,519
to begin with a clean slate.

82
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:33,519
Why?

83
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,360
Why should your revenge,

84
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:37,839
your schemes,

85
00:05:38,199 --> 00:05:39,680
cost her life?

86
00:05:48,839 --> 00:05:49,240
Ma Ding.

87
00:05:51,399 --> 00:05:51,879
I'm sorry.

88
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:53,800
♪When I get drunk♪

89
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:56,440
♪No one's left to hear me ramble♪

90
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:01,040
♪I said we'd walk hand in hand♪

91
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:03,600
♪And conquer every slope life throws♪

92
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,520
♪All those promises♪

93
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:11,760
♪We never got the chance to keep♪

94
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:16,320
♪How could you just♪

95
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:19,440
♪Turn to dust and fade away?♪

96
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:23,480
♪We dreamed, we dared♪

97
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,680
♪Through life and death, we never cared♪

98
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:27,080
♪The sweet, the fears♪

99
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:28,320
♪You were the shoulder, always there♪

100
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:30,720
♪This road is far too long♪

101
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,840
♪Without you walking by my side♪

102
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:34,240
♪The wind slips by, carrying your voice♪

103
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:36,320
♪Whispering, I hope you've been well♪

104
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,160
Hurry!

105
00:06:43,639 --> 00:06:44,000
Hello.

106
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,165
Excuse me,

107
00:06:45,166 --> 00:06:45,959
what happened in there?

108
00:06:45,959 --> 00:06:46,600
You two.

109
00:06:49,439 --> 00:06:49,800
Go inside.

110
00:06:50,319 --> 00:06:51,879
Get every detail on camera.

111
00:06:52,639 --> 00:06:53,120
Don't miss anything.

112
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,100
Whoa.

113
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,680
What happened to this guy?

114
00:06:56,879 --> 00:06:57,839
Who killed him?

115
00:07:00,199 --> 00:07:00,879
What happened to him?

116
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,680
Can you tell us exactly what happened?

117
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:06,519
Zhou Yan.

118
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:08,680
Natuo's gone.

119
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,639
Mian won again.

120
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,800
Why don't you look happy?

121
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,600
I lost everything a long time ago.

122
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,000
What does winning or losing matter now?

123
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:17,560
It's all over.

124
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,240
Is it?

125
00:07:20,399 --> 00:07:21,439
I told you before.

126
00:07:21,879 --> 00:07:22,959
Langia

127
00:07:22,959 --> 00:07:24,040
doesn't need Mian.

128
00:07:28,959 --> 00:07:29,560
I've got something to do.

129
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:30,399
I'll take my leave.

130
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:32,600
Dad.

131
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,279
I'll go check on him.

132
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:46,360
Enjoy the food and drinks, everyone!

133
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,399
Drink up!

134
00:07:48,319 --> 00:07:48,800
Come on.

135
00:07:50,519 --> 00:07:51,199
Drink up!

136
00:07:51,639 --> 00:07:53,240
Everyone, enjoy!

137
00:08:01,199 --> 00:08:01,800
Hey.

138
00:08:02,279 --> 00:08:03,000
Brothers!

139
00:08:03,879 --> 00:08:04,639
Quiet down.

140
00:08:04,639 --> 00:08:05,120
Listen up.

141
00:08:05,839 --> 00:08:07,040
Today, Boss

142
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:09,120
finally took down those three crooks.

143
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,720
Now it's finally our turn

144
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,600
to run Langia.

145
00:08:15,319 --> 00:08:15,839
So

146
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,279
as long as we stick with Mian,

147
00:08:17,839 --> 00:08:18,560
it's nothing but good times

148
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:19,920
from here on out.

149
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:25,160
Mian!

150
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:31,879
Mian!

151
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:33,919
Chug it!

152
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:34,639
Cheers!

153
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,480
Keep going!

154
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,000
Hey!

155
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:47,759
These are ready.

156
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:48,519
Come get them.

157
00:08:49,519 --> 00:08:50,000
Grab a skewer.

158
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:12,679
Take them.

159
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:15,720
Thanks.

160
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,480
(You're not some god of Langia.)

161
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,559
(All she wanted)

162
00:09:32,799 --> 00:09:33,840
(was to start over,)

163
00:09:34,679 --> 00:09:36,559
(to begin with a clean slate.)

164
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:39,559
(Why?)

165
00:09:41,159 --> 00:09:42,360
(Why should your revenge,)

166
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:43,960
(your schemes,)

167
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,679
(cost her life?)

168
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,120
Brothers.

169
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,279
Thanks for standing by me

170
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,600
all this time.

171
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:01,559
Without you,

172
00:10:02,559 --> 00:10:04,480
I could never have taken down
Langia's Three Scourges.

173
00:10:06,559 --> 00:10:07,799
We've fought our war.

174
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:09,440
We've had our revenge.

175
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:11,080
I...

176
00:10:11,879 --> 00:10:12,480
should go.

177
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:15,840
Why?

178
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:17,399
Where?

179
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:18,679
Boss,

180
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,399
you're the King of Langia now.

181
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:21,788
We still need you

182
00:10:21,789 --> 00:10:22,840
