183
00:10:23,559 --> 00:10:24,559
I'm not the King of Langia.

184
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:26,759
And I'm not Mian, either.

185
00:10:28,039 --> 00:10:29,080
I'm just passing through.

186
00:10:30,159 --> 00:10:31,879
Everything here
was always meant to be yours.

187
00:10:35,679 --> 00:10:36,080
Qiang.

188
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,519
I'm going back to Huaguo.

189
00:10:42,559 --> 00:10:44,080
A lot of you, like me,

190
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,440
are from Huaguo.

191
00:10:46,559 --> 00:10:47,879
Anyone want to go home with me?

192
00:10:49,799 --> 00:10:51,120
Anyone want to come go with me?

193
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,480
Yeah!

194
00:10:53,919 --> 00:10:54,240
Boss.

195
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,240
Wherever you go,

196
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:56,679
I'm going too.

197
00:11:00,279 --> 00:11:00,679
Zhou Yan.

198
00:11:01,519 --> 00:11:02,399
Are you really going back?

199
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:11,519
What's this?

200
00:11:12,519 --> 00:11:13,144
I found this key that day

201
00:11:13,145 --> 00:11:14,519
on the computer with the ledger on it.

202
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:21,120
(Please insert the BlackGold Key)

203
00:11:28,799 --> 00:11:29,840
The account is password-protected.

204
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:31,559
I don't know the password,

205
00:11:31,919 --> 00:11:32,916
but this has to be

206
00:11:32,917 --> 00:11:34,200
the key to accessing that account.

207
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:38,559
Zhou Yan.

208
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,679
This isn't over yet.

209
00:11:41,559 --> 00:11:43,000
Crime is still deeply rooted in Langia.

210
00:11:43,919 --> 00:11:45,200
Langia's Big Three may be gone,

211
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,948
but there'll always be

212
00:11:46,949 --> 00:11:48,080
new thugs coming along

213
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:48,799
to keep terrorizing people.

214
00:11:49,519 --> 00:11:50,919
But what's that got to do with me?

215
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:55,840
I came here to find Sihan.

216
00:11:57,559 --> 00:11:58,679
Now it's all over.

217
00:12:05,159 --> 00:12:06,440
Langia can do without Mian,

218
00:12:07,559 --> 00:12:08,639
but it can't do without you.

219
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:10,799
Zhou Yan.

220
00:12:11,559 --> 00:12:12,360
Stay.

221
00:12:54,919 --> 00:12:55,519
Double jokers!

222
00:13:05,519 --> 00:13:06,240
We're under attack!

223
00:13:06,879 --> 00:13:08,200
We're under attack!

224
00:13:09,639 --> 00:13:10,240
Run!

225
00:13:46,559 --> 00:13:47,000
Couldn't find it.

226
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,200
Go! Go!

227
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,039
Find that key!

228
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:50,679
Find that key!

229
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:55,720
Key? The key!

230
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:11,160
♪Dust rises along the border♪

231
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:12,480
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

232
