235
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:17,920
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

236
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:19,240
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

237
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:20,920
♪My life is mine to bear♪

238
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:23,760
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

239
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:26,360
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

240
00:14:26,680 --> 00:14:28,680
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

241
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:29,760
♪My fate is mine to command♪

242
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,040
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

243
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:32,320
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

244
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:33,640
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

245
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:34,920
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

246
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:36,280
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

247
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,600
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

248
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:38,920
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

249
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,200
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

250
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,560
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

251
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:43,080
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

252
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:44,480
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

253
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:45,840
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

254
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:48,880
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

255
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,560
♪With blood and sweat♪

256
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:53,960
♪I forge my glory♪

257
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:55,360
♪In this world of chaos♪

258
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,440
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

259
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:57,920
♪My legend♪

260
00:14:57,920 --> 00:14:59,400
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

261
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:06,560
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

262
